  "integrity_axes_note": "JSTRUCT is not dirtier than RAW on any integrity axis and is cleaner on two: fabricated claims 1 -> 0 and malformed output 5 -> 0 (all five RAW malformed responses were Qwen). Required-relation evidence is identical at 126/132 in both arms. The deficit is confined to witnesses the model failed to cite.",
  "next_step_per_protocol": "Any model failing non-inferiority closes the reader-facing representation line for this B1 workload. Do not invent another codec in response. The surviving product direction is qodec project / semantic projection plus raw JSON as the reader representation, with savings pursued through selection, omission, retrieval, caching and budget-aware projection rather than further reader syntax. The real-source holdout is not opened by this result, and qodec project v1 is not motivated by it.",
